<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>The Hungry Forest — Classroom Name Picker | SpeakKai</title><meta name="description" content="A playful classroom name picker with dancing characters, banana boosts and editable student names. Free to play, with no sign-in."><meta name="theme-color" content="#101c1c"><link rel="canonical" href="https://speakkai.com/forest/"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"></head><body><header><div class="brand"><a class="back-link" href="/resources/" aria-label="Back to SpeakKai Resources">← Resources</a><span class="mark">✦</span><div><small>SPEAKKAI · CLASSROOM PLAY</small><h1>The Hungry Forest</h1></div></div><div class="tools"><button id="music" aria-pressed="true">♫ Music on</button><button id="voice" aria-pressed="true">Character voice on</button><label>Volume <input id="volume" aria-label="Volume" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="55"></label><button id="hear-dog">▶ Hear character</button><button id="alarm">X · Alarm</button><button id="fullscreen">⛶ Fullscreen</button><span id="voice-status" role="status">Press Hear character or Start to enable speech.</span></div></header><main><section class="theater"><div class="quick-guide"><span><b>1</b> Add your class</span><span><b>2</b> Choose a character</span><span><b>3</b> Start the race</span></div><div class="scene-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE MOONLIT RUN · NO REPEATS</span><h2>Let the forest choose.</h2></div><p>Run left → right. Grab a banana. Meet your character.</p></div><div id="scene"><canvas id="canvas" aria-label="Students start visibly on the left and accelerate toward the selected character on the right"></canvas><div class="scene-badge">🍌 BANANAS = 2× SPEED</div><div id="dog-speech">Ready for your class!</div><div id="loading" role="status"><span class="loading-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>Growing your forest…</div><div id="result" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="chosen-title"><div class="result-card"><span class="eyebrow">THE FOREST HAS CHOSEN</span><h2 id="winner"></h2><h3 id="chosen-title">You have been chosen!</h3><p id="result-sub"></p><button id="next" class="primary">Next student →</button></div></div></div><div class="transport"><span id="status">Write the names, then start your adventure.</span><button id="start" class="primary" disabled>Start the run →</button><button id="pause" disabled>Pause</button><button id="reset">↺ Reset</button></div><div class="host-picker"><label for="host-select">Choose your character</label><select id="host-select"></select><small>Public-figure lines are fictional jokes, read by a synthetic narrator.</small></div><div class="dog-controls"><span>Character actions</span><label class="motion-label">Motion <select id="motion"><option value="wild">Wild</option><option value="gentle">Gentle</option></select></label><button data-action="auto" aria-pressed="true">Auto</button><button data-action="wave" aria-pressed="false">Wave</button><button data-action="dance" aria-pressed="false">Dance</button><button data-action="jump" aria-pressed="false">Jump</button><button data-action="stretch" aria-pressed="false">Stretch</button><button data-action="rest" aria-pressed="false">Rest</button></div><details class="joint-controls"><summary>Pose character joints</summary><p>Moving a slider enters manual pose mode.</p><div id="joint-sliders"></div></details><div class="history"><span class="eyebrow">CHOSEN SO FAR</span><output id="round-count">0 / 6 chosen</output><ol id="history"></ol><span id="empty">Everyone is waiting for their turn.</span></div></section><aside><div class="eyebrow">YOUR CLASS</div><h2>Write the names</h2><p class="intro">Add a name, pick a look, and let them race.<br>Names stay in this browser — no sign-in or upload.</p><div class="player-controls"><output id="player-count">6 players</output><button id="add-player">+ Add player</button><button id="six-players">Set to six</button><button id="undo-roster" hidden>Undo roster change</button></div><div id="roster"></div><details><summary>Paste a whole class</summary><label for="bulk">One name per line (up to 30)</label><textarea id="bulk" rows="6" placeholder="Player 1&#10;Player 2&#10;Player 3"></textarea><button id="apply-names">Use these names</button><p>Extra names reuse the five character pictures.</p></details><p class="hint">X = a one-second red alarm.<br>Music and the character’s voice start when you press Play or Start.</p></aside></main><div id="red-alert" aria-hidden="true"><strong>ALARM</strong></div><div id="announcement" class="sr" aria-live="polite"></div><noscript><p class="no-script">This game needs JavaScript. <a href="/resources/">Return to Resources</a>.</p></noscript><script>import "../scripts/forest/app.js";</script></body></html>
